when: "@runsAtLeast(2)"
---

## Chart table

::bg{location="chartroom" time="day"}
::actor{character="sefa" anchor="center" action="fadeInUp"}
@sefa{code="0010" emotion="shy"}: You've been down twice now. Twice more than anyone I've ever drawn a map for.
@sefa{code="0020"}: Every time you come up, tell me what you saw. Halls, doors, what lives in them. I'll draw it.
@ilo{code="0010"}: And when the map is done?
@sefa{code="0030" emotion="content"}: Then the next person who goes down doesn't have to die to learn it.

<branch id="chartAnswer" prompt="Sefa holds out a blank sheet.">
  <choice id="yes" text="Take the sheet">
    @ilo{code="0020"}: The long hall first. I know the long hall.
    ::set{user.bond.sefa += 1}
    ::accept{quest="sefaChart"}
  </choice>
  <choice id="later" text="Not yet">
    @sefa{code="0040" emotion="sad"}: Oh. Well. The sheet will keep.
  </choice>
</branch>
